---
title: "Krewire — The Go Framework for Web Artisans"
description: "Unified Go Framework for every workload — app, cli, site, book, worker, service, infra, runtime. One CLI kiw, one config. v0.1.0."
layout: Base
---

{{component "Hero" .}}

<section class="features py-6">
  <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight mb-1">One framework. Eight workloads.</h2>
  <p class="sub text-muted mb-5">From CLI to WASM frontend — same Go, same <code class="font-mono text-sm bg-bg-2 border border-border px-1 py-0.5 rounded">kiw</code>.</p>
  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-4">
    {{component "FeatureCard" (dict "Icon" "▲" "Title" "app" "Desc" "Fullstack monolith — web + API in one binary")}}
    {{component "FeatureCard" (dict "Icon" "›" "Title" "cli" "Desc" "Command-line apps with framework/tui")}}
    {{component "FeatureCard" (dict "Icon" "◧" "Title" "site" "Desc" "File-based .kiw DSL → static site, no JS by default")}}
    {{component "FeatureCard" (dict "Icon" "≡" "Title" "book" "Desc" "Manuscript → book via mdbind")}}
    {{component "FeatureCard" (dict "Icon" "⚙" "Title" "worker" "Desc" "Job queues, cron, retries, DLQ")}}
    {{component "FeatureCard" (dict "Icon" "⬢" "Title" "service" "Desc" "Registry, gateway, resilience, tracing")}}
    {{component "FeatureCard" (dict "Icon" "☁" "Title" "infra" "Desc" "Provider-agnostic IaC → AWS/K8s")}}
    {{component "FeatureCard" (dict "Icon" "◈" "Title" "runtime" "Desc" "Go→WASM, VDOM, mount points")}}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="cta my-9 p-7 border border-border rounded-2xl bg-bg-2">
  <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-2">Go-first. Zero JS until you need it.</h2>
  <p class="text-muted mb-3">Write pages as <code class="font-mono text-sm">pages/*.kiw</code> — frontmatter + HTML + scoped <code class="font-mono text-sm">&lt;style&gt;</code>. No toolchain, no npm.</p>
  <pre class="bg-[#0a0a0a] text-[#e5e7eb] p-4 rounded-xl overflow-auto"><code class="font-mono text-sm">kiw new my-site --site
kiw build
kiw serve</code></pre>
  <a class="btn primary inline-flex items-center px-4 py-2.5 rounded-full bg-primary text-white font-semibold mt-4" href="/docs/getting-started">Read the docs →</a>
</section>

{{component "Ecosystem" .}}

